    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stylish Two-Bedroom Ground Floor Apartment in a Private Development. \r\n\r\nA beautifully presented and recently renovated two-bedroom ground-floor apartment, ideally positioned between the highly sought-after areas of Ranelagh and Donnybrook. \r\n\r\nTucked discreetly away off Bushfield Avenue, this spacious apartment forms part of a mature development of just eight apartments, offering a quiet setting while remaining close to an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities. Extending to approximately 80 sq m, the apartment has been comprehensively upgraded and thoughtfully presented throughout. Recent improvements include new flooring, enhanced insulation, a new gas boiler, a contemporary bathroom, fresh decoration and new furniture. \r\n\r\nUpon entering, a generous hallway leads to a well-appointed, fully fitted kitchen and a bright, separate living room. The main bedroom is particularly impressive, featuring floor-to-ceiling windows, together with extensive wall-to-wall built-in wardrobes providing excellent storage. The second bedroom is also a good-sized double room, offering versatility for guests, a home office or additional living requirements. The modern shower room completes the accommodation. Further benefits include one designated private parking space. \r\n\r\nThe surrounding area offers an exceptional range of amenities. Donnybrook and Ranelagh provide an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday conveniences, while Herbert Park and the villages of Ballsbridge and Ranelagh are all within easy reach. The nearby Herbert Park is a particular highlight, offering expansive green space, tennis courts and weekend markets. Transport links are superb. The LUAS Green Line at Dunville Avenue is within walking distance, providing swift access to the city centre and beyond, while numerous Dublin Bus routes serve the immediate area. The property also enjoys convenient access to UCD, St Vincent’s Hospital and the principal business districts of Dublin 2 and Ballsbridge. \r\n\r\nEmail Enquiries Only. Please email your enquiry with full details to arrange a viewing. Due to the volume of enquiries, we may not be able to respond to everyone."
      },
